# Route: guide 44 of 50 of the simulator's completionist route for Skyborne
# (1539 of 1546 eligible quests, 166.6 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 58 to
# 59, 81 quests, 3.1 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Stormwind City, Dun Morogh, Wetlands, Tanaris, Feralas, Darkshore,
# Felwood, Hillsbrad Foothills, Tirisfal Glades, Burning Steppes, Redridge
# Mountains, Ironforge): Stormwind City -> near Stormwind -> near Stormwind
# City -> near Stormwind -> Stormwind City -> near Stormwind City -> Stormwind
# City -> Stormwind -> Stormwind City -> near Stormwind City -> near Stormwind
# -> near Stormwind City -> near Stormwind -> ….
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): Oh Brother... (167; Foreman
# Thistlenettle 20); Collecting Memories (168; Skeletal Miner 17-18, Undead
# Excavator 17-18, Undead Dynamiter 17-18).
